{
  "about": [
    "The owner-confirmation card's review bar (docs/owner-confirmation-review-contract.md §6–§9), as one set",
    "of cases both clients are proved against: the web reads this file in `OwnerConfirmationReview.test.tsx`",
    "(`reviewBar`, `reviewWindowWords`, `reviewAnswered`, `ownerAnswerLines`, `reviewCameInAfter`), the native",
    "client in `OwnerConfirmationReviewTests` (the `OwnerConfirmations` functions of the same names), so the",
    "browser, the Mac and the phone say one thing about one review, line for line.",
    "",
    "`bars`: a review as `GET /tasks/:taskId/owner-confirmation` publishes it, and where it is drawn (`CARD`: on",
    "the card that asks; `RECEIPT`: under the receipt a decision left) → what the bar draws. `reviewer` and",
    "`time` make the heading `REVIEW · <reviewer> · <time>`; `sha` sits at its right, struck through when",
    "`shaStruck`. `lines` are drawn in order: STATUS (an icon and a state word), NOTE (the quieter sentence",
    "under it), HEADLINE (Orbit's first line), ANSWERS (where the card draws its needsYou answer blocks), ROW",
    "(Checked / Not checked / Left open / Problem, with the keys of the lines it opens to), QUOTE (the reviewer's",
    "own words) and FOOTER. `folded` are",
    "the lines behind `Show the old review`. `reopen` says the bar offers Reopen task once the task has",
    "settled. Times are written by the test's clock: the ISO instant's UTC hours and minutes.",
    "",
    "`windows`: a review window in seconds → the words `No answer within <window>.` uses.",
    "",
    "`requests`: what one press of the card sends to `POST /tasks/:taskId/owner-confirmation` for the review",
    "the card drew and the answers chosen on it (`choices`: an option's index, or `{ \"other\": words }`); a",
    "question with no choice keeps its recommended option. `complete` false: an Other with no words yet, so",
    "Confirm done is disabled (§6 H4).",
    "",
    "`answers`: a recorded decision → the `Your answers` lines its receipt draws, and whether the receipt",
    "says `Before the review came in`."
  ],
